    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d149">

                <pb facs="0176" n="162" sameAs="frus:frus1944v06/pg162"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 P.W./9–2644</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wei</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-09-26">September 26,
                        1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to
                    inform you that I have just received the following telegraphic message, dated
                    September 25, 1944, addressed by the President of the Republic of China to the
                    President of the United States of America: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“I am in receipt of your message of September 18 [<hi rendition="#italic"
                                >16</hi>], announcing the results of your Quebec conversations with
                            Prime Minister Churchill, for which I am most grateful. Chiang Kai
                            Shek”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>I shall be greatly obliged if you will be good enough to transmit the above
                    message to its high destination.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wei Tao-ming</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
